[00:00.000] 作曲 : Alexander Bradley/Joss Farrington/John Riley/Ryan Sheperson
[01:42.543]Squadrons from the battle above breaking through the clouds
[01:47.598]Lancing iris of the sorceress: Cognizant of the pretence
[01:52.898]Blasting ejector, nervous frame, misfiring gyroscope
[01:58.189]Ammonium gleam rippling through corsair, skyward vortices
[02:23.034]Impacting warped membrane / Unwieldy portal / Skewed entry / Coveted godsend
[02:43.131]Visualising / Kaleidoscopic / Hexahedrons
[02:50.796]Glissade over an abstract moorland where a scabland tract penetrates the longitudes of quasicrystalline calderas
[03:32.425]Excreted from the fossil
[03:36.196]Viscous scrambling through wades of carbon ooze
[03:40.475]Vehicle lodged at the crest of an outstretched geological arm of anti-matter
[06:21.778]Slurp from the quasi-spout
[06:23.988]Subtracting elements enigmatized in the bloodstream
[06:27.526]Ingrained now: Hexatronic calcifications
[06:30.602]Capillaries dilate for utmost conduit impedance
[07:04.724]The hyper-solstice floods the multilayered plane with impossible illumination
[07:31.485]Osmosizing back from elsewhere
[07:36.881]Residue spume seeps from the cracks
[07:40.924]Warp-pod touched by time, aches and groans as it succumbs to it's confines
[07:46.317]Arcing bolts meander between ions, as the time bleed dissipates
[07:56.969]Neutralising / Interferometric / Zonohedrons
[08:15.602]Inevitable impressions in time like the lines drawn in the sand by a chariot
[08:20.884]Entranced by destinies’ call in the subconscious
[08:27.956]Supercentenarian oculus
[08:33.780]Epiphanic fluxing fumes
[08:39.730]Moonbase littered in impacts
[08:45.744]Soaked in dimensional blood...
